| Alerts | Twilio SMS |
| Calendar | Google Calendar API (OAuth 2.0) |
| Realtime | WebSockets (bidirectional ESP32 ↔ backend) |
| Caching | Redis |
| Containerisation | Docker + Docker Compose |

